    <string name="frost_tab_explainer">Your current wallpaper is managed outside Nexus, so frosted glass needs a one-time capture of it to blur behind widgets and folders. Android will ask you to confirm a brief screen capture — this app hides its own icons/widgets first, grabs one frame, and stops immediately, so only the wallpaper itself is saved.</string>
    <string name="frost_tab_theme_color_warning">Background Layer is set to “Theme Color” in Theme Settings, which replaces the wallpaper with a flat color everywhere — including frost. Frost won\'t show your captured wallpaper until this is switched to “Wallpaper”.</string>
    <string name="frost_tab_switch_layer">Switch Background Layer to Wallpaper</string>
    <string name="frost_tab_disabled_warning">Frosted Glass is turned off in Nexus Settings &gt; Appearance — frost won\'t show anywhere, including here, until it\'s re-enabled.</string>
